A note on the Plex Mono file names: these two faces are shipped here under the family name
"Plex Mono", not "IBM Plex Mono". The OFL 1.1 reserves the upstream Reserved Font Name for
the original, unmodified font, so a modified or subsetted build must be distributed under a
different name. This rename is OFL compliance, not a typo — do not "correct" it back to
"IBM Plex Mono".
